-- ============================================
-- NOTES
-- ============================================
-- 1. Adjust embedding dimension in chunks table based on your embedding model
-- 2. HNSW index provides better performance for large datasets
-- 3. Use vector_cosine_ops for cosine similarity (most common)
-- 4. Monitor index performance and adjust parameters as needed
-- 5. Consider partitioning chunks table if dataset grows very large (>10M rows)
